- id: C:statement/Nat.infinite_setOfPred_prime_modEq_one
  type: statement
  name: Nat.infinite_setOfPred_prime_modEq_one
  summary: The theorem Nat.infinite_setOfPred_prime_modEq_one, as the Lean file declares it.
