  summary: 43 is prime, so p = 43; 43 > 2, and 43 - 1 = 42 = 3 times 14, so 43 is congruent to 1 modulo 3; 6 cubed
    = 216 = 5 times 43 plus 1, so 6 has order exactly 3 modulo 43.
