    engine: model:blind-decompiler
- id: N:decision/least-prime-factor
  type: decision
  name: Take the least prime factor
  summary: The prime chosen is the least prime factor of the absolute value of the cyclotomic value.
  stance: opinion
  chose: the least prime factor
  because: It is a ready-made prime divisor of any number other than 1; the argument uses only that p is a prime
    dividing the value.
  provenance:
